WEBVTT

00:10:01.460 --> 00:10:04.360
I'm waiting for an intelligible message from space, and here is one.

00:10:04.440 --> 00:10:05.100
Is it intelligible?

00:10:05.160 --> 00:10:05.380
Yes.

00:10:05.520 --> 00:10:06.280
You can decipher it.

00:10:06.440 --> 00:10:07.420
Oh, for heaven's sake.

00:10:07.480 --> 00:10:10.960
Look, do you think the cosmos inhabited by a load of Boy Scouts sending Morse code?

00:10:11.160 --> 00:10:11.980
Look, what is this, Dennis?

00:10:12.140 --> 00:10:12.620
Is it a message?

00:10:13.050 --> 00:10:14.010
Have a look. Let me see.

00:10:15.100 --> 00:10:16.380
Could be from a distant probe.

00:10:17.240 --> 00:10:18.500
Or another planet.

00:10:24.120 --> 00:10:25.140
Maso, Samuel.

00:19:07.070 --> 00:19:08.530
You do not mind if we drive around?

00:19:08.970 --> 00:19:09.290
No.

00:19:10.030 --> 00:19:12.830
There's always so much tittle-tattle if one is seen in places.

00:19:13.240 --> 00:19:16.590
Herr Kaufmann, es folgt ein Taxi hinter uns hier.

00:19:18.610 --> 00:19:19.250
Ach so.

00:19:20.560 --> 00:19:21.880
Fahren Sie auf die Ringstrasse.

00:19:22.660 --> 00:19:23.200
Und Stuttgart?

00:19:23.280 --> 00:19:26.220
Mein Gespräch nach Stuttgart.

00:19:26.280 --> 00:19:27.100
In Ordnung, Herr Kaufmann.

00:19:29.280 --> 00:19:29.980
My chauffeur tells...

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:37.080
me we are being followed by a taxi not to worry there are always taxis in london he will see we

00:19:37.080 --> 00:19:43.740
get nowhere what is important is that i have my call to stuttgart smoking no thank you you

