Forgive me.

00:20:05.110 --> 00:20:05.350
Felix?

00:20:06.420 --> 00:20:07.240
That's Felix, right?

00:20:08.570 --> 00:20:09.090
Come and buy it!

00:20:09.620 --> 00:20:09.780
Yes!

00:20:25.080 --> 00:20:26.080
Tokyo, Monday night.

00:20:27.130 --> 00:20:27.310
Yes.

00:20:28.470 --> 00:20:28.970
I'll see you later!

00:20:32.810 --> 00:20:33.590
Excuse me.

00:20:34.490 --> 00:20:36.150
I have some work to do this afternoon.

00:20:36.530 --> 00:20:37.530
Then we will be quick.

00:20:42.890 --> 00:20:45.410
We have been very puzzled, you know, these past few months.

00:20:46.500 --> 00:20:49.380
I was in New York when I received this extraordinary news.

00:20:50.950 --> 00:20:52.230
It has gone, I told you.

00:20:55.210 --> 00:20:56.190
It really was a message.

00:20:57.160 --> 00:20:57.520
Yes.

00:20:57.680 --> 00:20:58.360
From a planet.

00:20:58.620 --> 00:20:59.700
A very distant planet.

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:01.160
Way in Andromeda, that's right.

00:21:02.430 --> 00:21:05.130
Well, that is a comfortable way away.

00:21:05.690 --> 00:21:06.770
What is all this?

00:21:07.320 --> 00:21:08.640
I am coming to that.

00:21:10.020 --> 00:21:12.220
In America, you know, there was very great excitement.

00:21:12.620 --> 00:21:14.300
Everybody was very much alarmed.

00:21:14.700 --> 00:21:17.100
And in Europe, in fact, everywhere.

00:21:18.140 --> 00:21:20.660
In your government, say, it is nothing.

00:21:21.060 --> 00:21:22.580
There is nothing, we will tell you later.

00:21:23.330 --> 00:21:24.310
And people forget.

00:21:25.280 --> 00:21:28.380
Months go by, there is no more scare, and people do forget.

00:21:29.030 --> 00:21:29.970
They have other things to...

00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:37.140
worry about. But there is something. Not officially. Oh no. Officially there is

00:21:37.140 --> 00:21:42.730
nothing. We have tried. But there is a complete blank wall. Everybody's lips are

00:21:42.730 --> 00:21:46.200
sealed. Including mine. You are working for the British government? Why should that

00:21:46.200 --> 00:21:51.220
interest you? Anything of importance interests us. This might be of the

00:21:51.220 --> 00:21:58.370
greatest importance. Might. Might not. But you are going on with the work. Please

00:21:58.370 --> 00:21:59.850
don't look so secretive.

00:22:00.480 --> 00:22:01.780
I'm not trying to pump you.

00:22:02.500 --> 00:22:04.620
No, I'm not going on.

00:22:05.540 --> 00:22:05.760
Why?

00:22:07.130 --> 00:22:09.170
I don't have to stay forever in government service.

00:22:09.490 --> 00:22:14.030
You would perhaps like something more lucrative with us?

00:22:15.600 --> 00:22:16.680
I did think so.

00:22:16.960 --> 00:22:21.240
Until your little fracker in Bradford.

00:22:21.730 --> 00:22:22.110
You know?

00:22:22.230 --> 00:22:24.210
You should not be so easy put off.

00:22:24.430 --> 00:22:25.110
I did not want...

00:22:25.110 --> 00:22:26.870
That was nothing to do with you.

00:22:28.130 --> 00:22:29.910
But you should not lead people to war.

00:22:30.000 --> 00:22:30.520
It's us.

00:22:32.180 --> 00:22:34.020
We might be busy on something else.

00:22:34.390 --> 00:22:34.930
Such as?

00:22:36.630 --> 00:22:37.550
I think...

00:22:38.630 --> 00:22:43.100
I think you should stay where you are, but you should keep in contact with me.

00:22:45.060 --> 00:22:45.480
How much?

00:22:47.620 --> 00:22:51.020
Excuse if you want me to give you information.

00:22:54.200 --> 00:22:55.760
Really, Dr. Bridger?

00:22:56.600 --> 00:22:57.880
You have no finesse.

00:23:01.820 --> 00:23:02.220
Kaufmann?

00:23:03.480 --> 00:23:03.640
Yes.

00:29:32.170 --> 00:29:33.150
Thank you.

00:51:02.290 --> 00:51:02.530
You

00:53:01.050 --> 00:53:01.310
You

01:08:32.940 --> 01:08:33.120
You

