01:30:43.910 --> 01:30:45.390
Today, suddenly...

01:30:45.480 --> 01:30:46.340
The answer is different.

01:30:46.920 --> 01:30:48.640
All the world knows it's different.

01:30:49.030 --> 01:30:53.890
and any aggressive power that might have had fancy ideas about orbital attack.

01:30:54.280 --> 01:30:55.320
