01:32:40.340 --> 01:32:42.100
It's a pushover when you know how.

01:32:42.540 --> 01:32:44.040
And suddenly you're in a commanding position.

01:32:44.180 --> 01:32:45.140
That was intended.

01:32:48.420 --> 01:32:49.160
Have you told them?

01:32:49.420 --> 01:32:50.220
Of course not.

01:32:50.890 --> 01:32:52.030
