01:33:46.730 --> 01:33:47.510
Come along, my dear.

01:33:48.740 --> 01:33:49.840
Brains and beauty first.

01:33:51.240 --> 01:33:52.140
Now, I'm in here, sir.

01:33:55.660 --> 01:33:57.480
Look, there's something I...

01:33:57.480 --> 01:33:58.660
For goodness sake, man!

01:34:03.280 --> 01:34:04.340
That's great, wasn't it?

01:34:04.460 --> 01:34:05.160
I did my best.

01:34:05.260 --> 01:34:05.560
Oh, great.

01:34:06.210 --> 01:34:07.970
There's no business like show business.

01:34:08.030 --> 01:34:09.950
At least you should have been allowed to speak to him.

01:34:10.560 --> 01:34:11.960
Oh, I suppose he's shrewd.

01:34:12.580 --> 01:34:14.200
Looks a bit of an old woman to me.

01:34:14.380 --> 01:34:14.940
He's like another.

01:34:15.170 --> 01:34:15.370
Who?

01:34:16.220 --> 01:34:19.370
A riger who went for a ride on a tiger.

01:34:20.530 --> 01:34:22.510
They finished the ride with a lady inside

01:34:22.510 --> 01:34:25.380
and a smile on the face of him.

01:34:26.280 --> 01:34:28.260
We're all going for a ride except you?

01:34:30.000 --> 01:34:31.300
Do you know what she said to me just now?

01:34:31.460 --> 01:34:31.680
No.

01:34:32.860 --> 01:34:33.360
Oh, it doesn't matter.

01:34:35.300 --> 01:34:36.700
I have an idea.

01:34:37.110 --> 01:34:38.170
One I'd understand.

01:34:41.480 --> 01:34:43.100
Look how beautifully he's ticking over.

01:34:44.200 --> 01:34:45.980
How sleek and rhythmically he is.

01:34:46.920 --> 01:34:48.520
Purring away with us inside it.

01:34:50.620 --> 01:34:51.760
