01:35:20.950 --> 01:35:22.540
Just rearrange it slightly.

01:35:22.900 --> 01:35:23.900
You're not going to do any damage.

01:35:25.300 --> 01:35:26.260
Perhaps I've fallen for her.

01:35:26.990 --> 01:35:27.910
Like you did, Christine.

01:35:29.060 --> 01:35:29.380
Scared.

01:35:30.000 --> 01:35:32.940
That's all I am of her. Scared, flaming stiff, and so should you all be.

01:35:33.060 --> 01:35:34.440
What are you playing at?

01:35:35.350 --> 01:35:38.330
You'd better carry on with your conducted tour. This is going to take time.

01:35:39.370 --> 01:35:40.410
