01:37:40.010 --> 01:37:40.630
No, not yet.

01:37:46.340 --> 01:37:46.780
It's working out.

01:37:48.520 --> 01:37:50.120
He's quite psychologically disturbed, isn't he?

01:37:50.200 --> 01:37:51.040
He thinks I'm dead.

01:37:51.340 --> 01:37:52.080
That's why it's calculating.

01:37:52.580 --> 01:37:53.520
I was telling I'm alive.

01:37:53.680 --> 01:37:54.720
Then I'll tell it you're dead again.

01:37:55.080 --> 01:37:57.380
I can go on playing this game until it doesn't know whether it's coming or going.

01:38:01.430 --> 01:38:02.230
Give me that.

01:38:03.030 --> 01:38:04.130
You can't win.

